Z||000000||Jay||12-27-2001||06:13 PM||||Saw this on ebay <A HREF="http://cgi.ebay.com/ebaymotors/aw-cgi/eBayISAPI.dll?ViewItem&item=599566629" TARGET=_blank>http://cgi.ebay.com/ebaymotors/aw-cgi/eBayISAPI.dll?ViewItem&item=599566629</A> <P>It says it comes with a GM V6 or could be converted to a 350 but doesn't say Fiero anywhere on the listing.  Says it uses custom chasis and GM chasis.  Anyone know of this car? If this is a kit for a fiero, I just might reconsider the Ferrari thing!<P>------------------<BR>Jay<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/newsig2_copy_1.jpg"> ||||reg||1
