Z||000002||artherd||12-27-2001||08:59 PM||||Yep! It's a Fiero!  I belive the 'kit' to make said car is as yet unavailable, however there are at least two prototypes in existance.<P>Looks like one is on ebay  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>I belive the chassis streatch is only 3" for this car (same as the F355 kits) the 11/12" streatches are for Lambo Countasch and Diablo kits, respectively (I think...)<P>Is it me, or does that wannabe Carrera GT look... not-quite-right somehow?  Is it too tall? Is it just those wheels?<P>I dunno.  I *like* it though  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> (both the kit, and the real mid-engine V10 Porsche concept  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Best!<BR>Ben.<BR><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/fiero/sig1.jpeg">      <BR>Ben Cannon<BR>88 Formula, T-top, Metalic Red.                     "Every Man Dies, not every man really Lives"<BR>88 Formula, Northstar, Silver, In-Progreess.                                        -Mel Gibson, "Braveheart"||||reg||1
